{"id":"mapes-dimatge-map-area-i-shapes","title":"Mapes d'imatge _ map, area i shapes","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","Html"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":1,"text":"Sin título","id":"sin-titulo"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":72,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-04-13-05-26","title":"Sesion_04_13.05.26","topicLabel":"HTML","session":4}],"html":"<h1 id=\"sin-titulo\" class=\"note__h note__h--1\">Sin título</h1><h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Un mapa d&#39;imatge permet crear diferents zones clicables dins d&#39;una sola imatge. És com dividir una foto en àrees invisibles que porten a enllaços diferents. Cada zona es defineix amb l&#39;etiqueta <code>&lt;area&gt;</code> i pot tenir forma de rectangle (<code>rect</code>), cercle (<code>circle</code>) o polígon (<code>poly</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">Html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;aula.jpg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">usemap</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;#mapa-aula&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">map</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mapa-aula&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">area</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">shape</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rect&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">coords</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;34,44,270,350&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ordenador.html&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Zona ordenadors&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">area</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">shape</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;circle&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">coords</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;337,300,44&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;profesor.html&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Mesa profesor&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">map</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>"}